WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.682 line:82%
Chapter 9. Attendance: your seating plan, the register, behaviour, and picking a student.

00:00:08.109 --> 00:00:10.760 line:82%
Open "Attendance" in the menu.

00:00:11.212 --> 00:00:16.340 line:82%
First, draw your classroom. You do this only once. Choose "Arrange seats".

00:00:16.794 --> 00:00:21.700 line:82%
Set the number of rows, and of desk columns. Each desk has two seats.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:29.341 line:82%
Press "Fill empty seats". Then drag each student to their real place. Students keep their seats every day.

00:00:29.799 --> 00:00:36.421 line:82%
"More" has extra tools. "Flip class" turns the plan around, so you see the class from your desk.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:42.119 line:82%
Now take attendance. Choose "Attendance", and click a student who is absent.

00:00:42.574 --> 00:00:47.039 line:82%
Click again for Late, again for Excused, and again for Present.

00:00:47.506 --> 00:00:54.581 line:82%
Then press "Everyone else is present". Students who join a test are also marked present by themselves.

00:00:55.047 --> 00:01:00.820 line:82%
For behaviour, choose "Behaviour", and click a student. Choose a good or a bad reason.

00:01:01.274 --> 00:01:08.460 line:82%
A thumbs up adds one bonus point, and a thumbs down takes one away. "Edit reasons" changes the list.

00:01:08.921 --> 00:01:16.061 line:82%
The small "i" on a student shows their history for the year: absences, lates, notes and behaviour.

00:01:16.525 --> 00:01:23.480 line:82%
Close it. When no one raises their hand, press the target button at the top. It is on every page.

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:35.699 line:82%
Only students who are here can be picked, and nobody is picked twice until everyone has had a turn. Press "Good answer" to give one bonus point.

00:01:36.165 --> 00:01:42.979 line:82%
Students can also check in on their phones. Press "More", "Students check in", then "Start check-in".

00:01:43.441 --> 00:01:52.980 line:82%
On the phone, students tap their name and type the code on your screen. The code changes every 20 seconds, so a student at home can't check in.

00:01:53.442 --> 00:01:59.819 line:82%
Names turn green. Press "Finish check-in". Students who did not check in are marked absent.

00:02:00.281 --> 00:02:05.199 line:82%
"Student reports" lets each student see their own report on their phone.

00:02:09.748 --> 00:02:16.100 line:82%
The student taps their name, and sees their attendance, behaviour, bonus points and test scores.

00:02:16.563 --> 00:02:19.440 line:82%
Press "Close reports" when you finish.

00:02:19.894 --> 00:02:26.840 line:82%
"Summary" and "Register" show the totals and a register like on paper. Both export to Excel.
